<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups First Data.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups First Data.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst Greg Gould said he raised First Data Corp to priority list buy from recommended list buy</p>
<p>-- Analyst says earnings estimates are $1.60/shr for 1997, $1.90 for 1998</p>
<p>-- Long term growth trend in 20 percent range is intact, analyst says</p>
<p>-- Analyst says within card processing business, a segment offering expanded services to clients is growing in the 60-100 pct range</p>
</text>
